WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
One order, two conflicting records.
Replay of a real API run from 10 October 2026.

00:05.000 --> 00:11.000
Save status = pending.
The supplied record supports pending.

00:11.000 --> 00:21.000
Add status = paid. Both values conflict.
The API returns UNKNOWN and asks for review.

00:21.000 --> 00:28.000
Remove the incorrect paid record.
Pending is supported again.

00:28.000 --> 00:35.000
Correct the remaining record from pending to paid.
The corrected value is now supported.

00:35.000 --> 00:40.000
Delete only the demonstration records.
No remaining evidence: UNKNOWN.

00:40.000 --> 00:45.000
Replay with python quickstart.py --replay,
or run against the API with your own key.
